<title>GERMANY: TENNIS-GERMAN OPEN FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-GERMAN OPEN FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>HAMBURG, Germany 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round results in the $2.3 million German Open men's tennis tournament on Tuesday (prefix number denotes seeding): Slava Dosedel (Czech Republic) beat Renzo Furlan (Italy) 7-6 (7-5) 6-2 Nicolas Kiefer (Germany) beat Marzio Martelli (Italy) 4-6 7-6 (7-4) 6-2  </p>
<p>Marcello Craca (Germany) beat Marc Goellner (Germany) 6-4 6-3</p>
</text>
